# target/

Rust compiler and build system artifacts directory managed by Cargo. Contains compiled binaries, build metadata, documentation, and compiler caches organized by build profile.

## Dirs

- `debug/` -- debug build artifacts and incremental compilation cache
- `doc/` -- rustdoc-generated HTML documentation for dependencies
- `flycheck0/` -- rust-analyzer incremental check cache
- `release/` -- optimized release build artifacts

## Files

- `.rustc_info.json` -- compiler fingerprint and feature detection metadata
- `.rustdoc_fingerprint.json` -- rustdoc generation metadata and version info
- `CACHEDIR.TAG` -- cache directory tag (per bford.info/cachedir spec)
